To enable Dynamic Shape support, is it fair to expect the user to switch their torch.Tensor objects to XLATensor? If yes, when/how should they transition back and forth between torch.Tensor objects and XLATensor objects?
This document summarizes the details of our XLATensor concept.
class XLATensor(torch.Tensor):
    def expand(self, size):
        if self.dev_ == 'TPU':
            if size.dynamic_size_tensor != None:
                result = self.t_.expand(size.static_size)
                return XLATensor(result.tolist())

