We can add a mode to support no sharding strategy, if users do not specify CPU offload, it works like DDP;
but if users specify CPU offload, then it works like DDP + CPU offload, which could potentially be a performant version to scale, as it does not need all_gather communication.  It is good to run experiments by comparing the performances btw 'fully_shard on GPUs' vs 'no shard + CPU offload' for the same large model like 175B transformer model.
